          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iirari Aab ŋakiro ke Eliya, tocil Aab ŋilowi keŋ, tolaca, tonap ŋiguniyae; toŋer akimuj, ido toper loguniae, tolomak akilat esiliyorit itubulito ŋakiro etau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiŋit nai Ekapolon ekadwaran Eliya tema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Idau ba iyoŋ aanyun epite ŋolo etiditeunor Aab alokiŋaren kaŋ? Aŋuna etiyaa iŋes ŋun, nyacamakini ayoŋ ŋican potu neni keŋ alorwa a ŋulu ka akiyar keŋ, nai epote ŋican ŋul lotuŋa ka Aab edoli ŋirwa ŋulu ka akiyar a lokoku keŋ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.29"
            ]
          }
        }
